## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: Abilities
## Notes: Sane UI's spells and abilities. Docked at the screen's bottom middle: click the middle of the bottom edge, or press your spellbook or talents key, and our own spellbook, talents, Sane Macros and the action bars fill the screen; Esc and they go back. The spells you have not learned yet are in your spellbook, in grey, and a Home page says what you can learn now. Drag a grey spell onto an action bar button and the button is reserved until you learn the spell. The game's action bars clean, out of sight at rest. Type /sane abilities.
## Author: Saneroki
## Version: 0.3.0
## Category: Sane UI
## Group: SaneUI
## Dependencies: SaneUI
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Book_09
## X-License: MIT

