Talents\Talents.lua
# The nodes: the game's shared node buttons with the class talents' glow, tooltip and sounds; the arrows
Talents\Nodes.lua
# What the trees stand on: the class's picture, its clouds and lights, the frame and dividers, the commit's flash
Talents\Art.lua
# Each tree's head with the points spent in it, and the unspent points
Talents\Headers.lua
# The primary and secondary specialization: the game's tabs, Active or Activate
Talents\Specs.lua
# Apply Changes, Undo and the Reset menu at the foot
Talents\Foot.lua
# The commit's and the switch's cast over the trees, on a cast bar of ours from the game's template
Talents\Commit.lua
# Buying, refunding, applying, undoing and resetting, where the game allows it
Talents\Changes.lua
# The frame: the game's shared talent frame with the class layer over it, its events while shown
Talents\Tree.lua
# Spellbook: our own window of your spells, as the game's (Spellbook/; the game's own book's extras are Book/)
